payphone-easter-egg-no-answer = You dial a random number. No answer. Try again.
payphone-easter-egg-already-called = You can't bring yourself to dial that number again.
payphone-easter-egg-calling = Payphone calling...
payphone-easter-egg-calling-again = Calling...
payphone-easter-egg-calling-still = Calling still...
payphone-easter-egg-ocean = Then the ocean breaks. Out of the depths a woman's voice emerges, small, the dearest ever heard.
payphone-easter-egg-hello = "Hello?" She sounds sleepy.
payphone-easter-egg-stunned = You can't react... You are stunned...
payphone-easter-egg-beautiful = You say, "Your voice is beautiful."
payphone-easter-egg-recognition = "It's you, isn't it?" she says.
payphone-easter-egg-revolutionary = You say, "I am a revolutionary servant of humanity. I will free mankind and abolish the classes. I will raise the dead."
payphone-easter-egg-drunk = "You are not revolutionary, you are drunk."
